      "summary": "\"Ocean Man\" is a song by American experimental rock band Ween, and is the penultimate track from their sixth album The Mollusk. It was released as the B-side to the earlier single \"Mutilated Lips\" on June 24, 1997.\n\nIt was featured during the first set of end credits in The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie, and on the film soundtrack. <a href=\"http://www.last.fm/music/Ween/_/Ocean+Man\">Read more on Last.fm</a>.",
